{"ref":"BDB, קְצָת","hw":"קְצָת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קְצָת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. end (</strong>Lag<sup>BN 10</sup> Ges<sup>§ 95 n</sup><strong>)</strong>;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:68\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.68\">Ne 7:69</a> (Gi Baer, v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:69\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.69\">70</a> van d. H.) +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצָתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:5\" href=\"/Daniel.1.5\">Dn 1:5</a>; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצָוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:5\" href=\"/Exodus.38.5\">Ex 38:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:9\" href=\"/Psalms.65.9\">ψ 65:9</a> (+ perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">קצוותו</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:8\" href=\"/Exodus.37.8\">Ex 37:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:4\" href=\"/Exodus.39.4\">39:4</a> Kt. v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, קָצָה²\" href=\"/BDB,_קָצָה²\", dir=\"rtl\">קָצָה</a>; Kö<sup>ii. 1, 61</sup> der. these pl. forms from [<span dir=\"rtl\">קָ֫צוּ</span>]);—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>end</em>, of <em>corners</em> of grating <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:5\" href=\"/Exodus.38.5\">Ex 38:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצוֹתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:4\" href=\"/Exodus.27.4\">27:4</a>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:8\" href=\"/Exodus.37.8\">Ex 37:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:4\" href=\"/Exodus.39.4\">39:4</a> supr. (all P); <em>ends</em> of earth <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:9\" href=\"/Psalms.65.9\">ψ 65:9</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְצָת</span> (some) <em>from the end of, some of</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> <strong>3 b</strong>) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:68\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.68\">Ne 7:69</a> (so NH), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:2\" href=\"/Daniel.1.2\">Dn 1:2</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">מִק׳</span> <em>at the end of</em> a certain time <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:5\" href=\"/Daniel.1.5\">Dn 1:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:15\" href=\"/Daniel.1.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 1:18\" href=\"/Daniel.1.18\">18</a>.","next":"BDB, קצה","prev":"BDB, קָ֫צוּ"}